 "how": "rotopt -template shaman_ele -race Troll -durs 180 -eval -level 60, the preset's knobs (chainLightning=0,lightningBoltDownrank=2,lavaBurstFlameShockLeft=2,prepullBolt=1,earthShockFinish=1,waterTotemMinTime=20,shield=1,shieldMinMana=50,shieldMinTime=60,prepullShield=1,flameShockMinTime=9,manaTideMana=10,lightningBoltDownrankManaPerSec=20) plus berserkingAfterMastery=1 (tools/rotopt/shaman_ele.go). Both cooldowns come off at the pull, so Lightning Bolt went 2.0 -> 1.5 sec (Mastery) -> 1.36 sec (Berserking), floored at the 1.5 sec GCD: Berserking was worth +0.15 DPS with the autocast. Remade 2026-10-28 with the preset's per-second lower-rank Lightning Bolt line (standards 31); the gain is over that new preset rotation at Troll, paired over 20000 iterations (se from 8 seeds x 2500)."
